# Arc: HyralArc | Scene: HyralOrc2

translate it strings:

    old "A few yards, in a cage very similar to hers, she saw two shadow figures, moving."
    new "A pochi metri, in una gabbia molto simile alla sua, vide due figure ombrose muoversi."

    old "A large orc stood near the cage, hitting the bars with a stick."
    new "Un grosso orco stava vicino alla gabbia, picchiando sul recinto con un bastone."

    old "A ferocious screaming and roaring exploded as he was crowned the victor."
    new "Un urlare e un ruggire feroci esplosero quando fu incoronato vincitore."
